# zig-only
# The mouse wheel scrolls the Settings list — the box is 35 rows tall for
# a 60-row list. A notch down moves the top of the list away; the cursor
# follows the window (the row it marks is always visible), and a notch
# up brings the top back.
command view.settings
expect screen contains "── UI ──"
scroll 60 20 down
expect screen lacks "── UI ──"
scroll 60 20 up
expect screen contains "── UI ──"
scroll 60 20 down
scroll 60 20 down
scroll 60 20 down
scroll 60 20 down
scroll 60 20 down
scroll 60 20 down
scroll 60 20 down
scroll 60 20 down
scroll 60 20 down
scroll 60 20 down
expect screen contains "── Editor ──"
expect screen contains "▸"
